## Framework measurement order and visibility

In-turn evaluation-tool results are trusted local validation, not official A/B
acceptance. The tool runs the configured stages, including the benchmark, even
when a call names only accuracy. Its stage records expose verdicts and metrics;
an empty artifact list does not grant access to the operator's raw logs. Record
that visibility gap without guessing hidden paths, inventing evidence, or
repeating an unchanged measurement to retrieve logs.

When the production source is ready, return `nominated` with null canonical
metrics and an empty {{ reply.next_step }} so the framework can run independent
review and official gates. Do not wait for those later stages inside this turn
or classify ready source as blocked solely because they have not run yet.
